        ("Fundamental of Electronics and Engineering", "In CMOS digital circuits, dynamic power dissipation is directly proportional to:", "The switching frequency and the square of the supply voltage.", "The static leakage current.", "The threshold voltage of the NMOS transistor.", "The physical distance between the VDD and GND rails.", "The switching frequency and the square of the supply voltage."),
        ("Fundamental of Electronics and Engineering", "According to Boolean Algebra, the Consensus Theorem states that AB + A'C + BC is equal to:", "AB + AC", "AB + A'C", "BC", "A + B + C", "AB + A'C"),
