        ("Fundamental of Mechanical Engineering", "For the same compression ratio and heat input, how does the thermal efficiency of the Otto cycle compare to the Diesel cycle?", "Otto cycle is more efficient", "Diesel cycle is more efficient", "Both are equally efficient", "Depends on the specific heat ratio of the working fluid", "Otto cycle is more efficient"),
