        ("Fundamental of Mechanical Engineering", "On the Iron-Carbon equilibrium diagram, the eutectoid transformation of austenite to pearlite occurs at what approximate temperature and carbon content?", "727°C and 0.76% C", "1147°C and 4.3% C", "1495°C and 0.17% C", "727°C and 2.14% C", "727°C and 0.76% C"),
