        ("Fundamental of Mechanical Engineering", "For a fully developed laminar flow in a circular pipe, how does the Darcy friction factor (f) relate to the Reynolds number (Re)?", "f = 16 / Re", "f = 64 / Re", "f = 0.316 / Re^0.25", "f = 64 / Re^2", "f = 64 / Re"),
        ("Fundamental of Mechanical Engineering", "Under choked flow conditions in a converging-diverging nozzle, the Mach number at the throat is exactly:", "0", "0.5", "1.0", "Greater than 1.0", "1.0"),
