        ("Fundamental of Mechanical Engineering", "The effectiveness of a heat exchanger is defined as the ratio of:", "Actual heat transfer to the maximum possible heat transfer", "Heat capacity of the hot fluid to the cold fluid", "Log mean temperature difference to the maximum temperature difference", "Overall heat transfer coefficient to the convective coefficient", "Actual heat transfer to the maximum possible heat transfer"),
