        ("Fundamental of Mechanical Engineering", "In a simple gear train, if the number of intermediate idler gears is odd, the rotational direction of the driven gear will be:", "Opposite to the driving gear", "The same as the driving gear", "Perpendicular to the driving gear", "Dependent on the gear ratio", "The same as the driving gear"),
