        ("Soft Skills", "In the Shannon-Weaver model of communication, what does the term 'entropy' refer to?", "The emotional resonance of the message", "The amount of uncertainty or unpredictability in a message", "The physical distance between sender and receiver", "The feedback loop's latency", "The amount of uncertainty or unpredictability in a message"),
