        ("Soft Skills", "The STAR method is a highly recommended framework for answering behavioral interview questions. What does the acronym stand for?", "Situation, Task, Action, Result", "Strategy, Timing, Assessment, Review", "Subject, Theme, Argument, Rationale", "Skill, Talent, Aptitude, Readiness", "Situation, Task, Action, Result"),
