        ("Engineering Math 2", "A function f(z) expanded in an annulus region r1 < |z-a| < r2 containing a singularity at z=a is represented by a:", "Taylor Series", "Fourier Series", "Maclaurin Series", "Laurent Series", "Laurent Series"),
