        ("Engineering Math 2", "The Argument Principle states that the contour integral of f'(z)/f(z) dz equals 2*pi*i multiplied by:", "The sum of the residues inside the contour", "The number of zeros minus the number of poles inside the contour", "The total number of singularities", "The maximum modulus of f(z)", "The number of zeros minus the number of poles inside the contour"),
